# Leave this unset and the app finds the gateway on the machine Metro served
# the bundle from, port 8787 — which is right for Expo Go on a phone, for the
# web build, and for a simulator. Set it only to override that:
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8787   # Android emulator
#
# Start the gateway with:  cd ../meet-mobile-tap && npm run dev
